>>
Rule 149 (String not allows to be a linear value)
{v_1 : str} |= v_1 ≠ "linear"
>>
Rule 150 (The last dimension value must greater than 0.)
{v_1 : tensor} |= shape(v_1, ndim(v_1) - 1) > 0
